  {
    "id": "REL1",
    "badge": "CGL 2024",
    "question": {
      "en": "Find value of $(x - 1/x)$ if $x^2 - 3x + 1 = 0$.",
      "hi": "यदि $x^2 - 3x + 1 = 0$ है, तो $(x - 1/x)$ का मान ज्ञात कीजिए।"
    },
    "options": "(a) $\\sqrt{5}$ &emsp; (b) 3 &emsp; (c) 2 &emsp; (d) $\\sqrt{3}$",
    "solution": {
      "en": "From equation: $x + 1/x = 3$.<br>We know $(x - 1/x)^2 = (x + 1/x)^2 - 4 = 9 - 4 = 5 \\implies x - 1/x = \\mathbf{\\sqrt{5}}$.<br><br><strong>Answer: (a) $\\sqrt{5}$</strong>",
      "hi": "समीकरण से: $x + 1/x = 3$।<br>हम जानते हैं कि $(x - 1/x)^2 = (x + 1/x)^2 - 4 = 9 - 4 = 5 \\implies x - 1/x = \\mathbf{\\sqrt{5}}$ है।<br><br><strong>उत्तर: (a) $\\sqrt{5}$</strong>"
    }
  }
]